Description: Mahfin desktop client with mpv playback
 Desktop client for a Mahfin server, built on Qt WebEngine and libmpv.
 Plays the original file untouched in almost every case: Matroska, HEVC,
 10-bit, DTS, TrueHD and multi-track audio all decode natively, so the
 server does not transcode.
